

>> Cat := Chinthu chatsopano.

Cat chikafika: ['chatsopano'] chitani: {
	zake sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat chikafika: ['nieuw'] chitani: {
	zake sound := ['meow!'].
}.

Cat chikafika: ['makeSound'] chitani: { <- zake sound.
}.

Cat chikafika: ['greet'] chitani: { <- wekha makeSound.
}.

>> cat := Cat chatsopano.
Zotuluka lembani: cat greet.
